tenBlocks.block5_shots:
SHOT 1 | 0–4s
Wide locked view inside @family_living_room in soft morning light, @Shaz sits cross-legged center on carpet wearing matte black sunglasses holding Yugioh cards to chest and breathing gently, @Sister sits left, @Brother sits right, @Mom stands behind, all blinking softly.
@DadShaz, voiceover: {When I was eight, I did not talk much.}
Hard cut.

SHOT 2 | 4–8s
Medium close on @Shaz looking up wearing matte black sunglasses and speaking with flat conviction, @Mom leans in listening and blinking softly in @family_living_room.
@Shaz: {I want to be a scientist.}
Hard cut.

SHOT 3 | 8–12s
Warm medium on @Mom smiling with hands together and breathing warmly, @Shaz watches wearing matte black sunglasses and blinking in @family_living_room.
@Mom: {Really? I am so proud of you!}
Hard cut.

SHOT 4 | 12–17s
Low carpet-level view in @family_living_room, @Sister lays Yugioh cards on rug, @Brother slaps a card down and bounces, @Shaz studies cards clamped to chest, all shifting and breathing.
Hard cut.

SHOT 5 | 17–21s
Medium on @Sister waving a card and calling out with quick playful energy, @Shaz wearing matte black sunglasses and @Brother look at her and blink in @family_living_room.
@Sister: {Shaz, watch Yugioh GX with us!}
Hard cut.

SHOT 6 | 21–26s
Energetic medium in @family_living_room, @Brother holds up trap cards and bounces on knees breathing fast, @Shaz grips his cards wearing matte black sunglasses, @Sister laughs and shifts.
@Brother: {Battle me! I have trap cards!}
Hard cut.

SHOT 7 | 26–30s
Wide slow-rising view in @family_living_room, @Shaz leans back with cards wearing matte black sunglasses, @Sister and @Brother lean in, @Mom watches warmly, all breathing gently.
@DadShaz, voiceover: {We watched Yugioh GX together. That was our thing.}
Hard cut.

