tenBlocks.block5_shots:
SHOT 1 | 0–4s
Golden late-afternoon wide outside @driveway_family_home, @TeenShaz stands beside faded 2000 Honda Accord Coupe with dull paint and windows down, hand on roof, breathing with pride and blinking.
