Bright daytime move through @school_hallway_classroom, @AdultShaz walks down hallway then sits at desk typing Python and Ruby on Rails on screen, breathing steadily and blinking.
@DadShaz, voiceover: {I graduated early, then learned Python and Ruby on Rails.}
Hard cut.

SHOT 6 | 23–30s
Warm office medium in @school_hallway_classroom, @AdultShaz sits at desk with certificate papers, smiles with relief and speaks, breathing softly.
@AdultShaz: {At nineteen, I got my first software job with salary and benefits!}
Hard cut.

